Seam: chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/BUILD.gn, source_set("impl") -- the
      target settings_clear_browsing_data_handler.cc builds in.
Why: GN wiring for patch 0192. The hook includes an //arcium/ui/browser
     header, and this target has no dep, direct or transitive, on any Arcium
     target or on //chrome/browser/ui, so `gn check` rejects the include
     outright.

     No cycle: //arcium/ui/browser depends on nothing that reaches back into
     this target, so `gn gen` accepts the graph with this dep added.
Delegates to: nothing. GN wiring carries no call.

